# Scenario name
msgid "Defenders or Pirates"
msgstr "Defenders or Pirates"

# Scenario description
msgid ""
"Amass reputation by destroying enemies or grabbing and selling cargo\n"
"\n"
"Designed for 1-32 player ships. Duration: 45 minutes. Features many non-"
"standard player ships.\n"
"\n"
"Version 1\n"
"\n"
"USN Discord: https://discord.gg/PntGG3a where you can join a game online. "
"There's usually one every weekend. All experience levels are welcome."
msgstr "Amass reputation by destroying enemies or grabbing and selling cargo\n\nDesigned for 1-32 player ships. Duration: 45 minutes. Features many non-standard player ships.\n\nVersion 1\n\nUSN Discord: https://discord.gg/PntGG3a where you can join a game online. There's usually one every weekend. All experience levels are welcome."

