msgstr "In politics and trade, bruisers and pirates are of better promise than talkers and clerks."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:11068
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "I am a man of fortune and must seek my fortune."
msgstr "I am a man of fortune and must seek my fortune."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:11072
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "In an honest service, there is thin commons, low wages, and hard labor."
msgstr "In an honest service, there is thin commons, low wages, and hard labour."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:11076
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"Revenge may sate your being, but don't misunderstand me. It's an end, not a "
"beginning."
msgstr "Revenge may sate your being, but don't misunderstand me. It's an end, not a beginning."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:11080
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"Betrayin's all part of piratin'. If you don't know that, you're not even "
"close to being a pirate."
msgstr "Betrayin's all part of piratin'. If you don't know that, you're not even close to being a pirate."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:11084
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "Aye, the sea whispers secrets only the brave dare to listen."
msgstr "Aye, the sea whispers secrets only the brave dare to listen."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:11088
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "Ye have the heart of a sea serpent - cold and deep as the abyss itself."
msgstr "Ye have the heart of a sea serpent - cold and deep as the abyss itself."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:11092
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "Weigh anchor! The dawn's light brings promise of plunder and glory."
msgstr "Weigh anchor! The dawn's light brings promise of plunder and glory."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:11096
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"Let the sea's song guide us to untold riches, hidden where X marks the spot."
msgstr "Let the sea's song guide us to untold riches, hidden where X marks the spot."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:11100
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "Marooned by fate, saved by wit and will - such is the pirate's plight."
msgstr "Marooned by fate, saved by wit and will - such is the pirate's plight."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:11104
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"A chest of gold, a bottle of rum, and a sky alight with stars - pirate's "
"paradise."
msgstr "A chest of gold, a bottle of rum, and a sky alight with stars - pirate's paradise."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:11108
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"Coolant's the fuel that stirs the soul and emboldens the spirit of adventure."
msgstr "Coolant's the fuel that stirs the soul and emboldens the spirit of adventure."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:11112
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "A sword's edge and a cunning mind carve the path to treasures untold."
msgstr "A sword's edge and a cunning mind carve the path to treasures untold."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:11116
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"Let no man be called a landlubber when the call of the ocean beckons his "
"heart."
msgstr "Let no man be called a landlubber when the call of the ocean beckons his heart."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:11120
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"The code of the sea is written in the blood of those who dare to defy it."
msgstr "The code of the sea is written in the blood of those who dare to defy it."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:11124
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"Only in the dead of night, under the moon's watchful eye, do true pirates "
"ply their trade."
msgstr "Only in the dead of night, under the moon's watchful eye, do true pirates ply their trade."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:11128
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"The call of the deep is a siren's song, luring the unwary to their doom or "
"glory."
msgstr "The call of the deep is a siren's song, luring the unwary to their doom or glory."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:11132
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"In the shadow of the mast, we find solace in the brotherhood of outcasts."
msgstr "In the shadow of the mast, we find solace in the brotherhood of outcasts."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:11136
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"The gleam of treasure is not in its worth, but in the adventure it promises."
msgstr "The gleam of treasure is not in its worth, but in the adventure it promises."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:11140
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "Gold and glory, the twin sirens that lead us through peril to paradise."
msgstr "Gold and glory, the twin sirens that lead us through peril to paradise."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:11144
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"Let our laughter echo across the waves, a testament to the joy found in "
"lawlessness."
msgstr "Let our laughter echo across the waves, a testament to the joy found in lawlessness."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:11148
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"We are the shadows that slip through the night, the whisper of danger on the "
"wind."
msgstr "We are the shadows that slip through the night, the whisper of danger on the wind."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:11247
#, lua-format
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "We've stopped and %s has stopped."
msgstr "We've stopped and %s has stopped."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:11261
#, lua-format
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"We've stopped but %s hasn't. We can't get loot while they're moving. Shoot "
"out their engines to make them stop."
msgstr "We've stopped but %s hasn't. We can't get loot while they're moving. Shoot out their engines to make them stop."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:11278
#, lua-format
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "%s has stopped. We have to stop, too, if we're going to get some loot."
msgstr "%s has stopped. We have to stop, too, if we're going to get some loot."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:11293
#, lua-format
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "%s and %s both have to be stopped if we're going to get loot from %s."
msgstr "%s and %s both have to be stopped if we're going to get loot from %s."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:11327
#, lua-format
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "%s and %s have both stopped."
msgstr "%s and %s have both stopped."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:11342
#, lua-format
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"We're stopped and another ship has stopped, but %s, the closest cherry to be "
"picked, has not stopped."
msgstr "We're stopped and another ship has stopped, but %s, the closest cherry to be picked, has not stopped."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:11357
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "We need to stop too if we want to get any loot."
msgstr "We need to stop too if we want to get any loot."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:11374
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "We can't loot any cargo because we have no room in our cargo hold."
msgstr "We can't loot any cargo because we have no room in our cargo hold."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:11386
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "We've got room in our cargo hold for some loot."
msgstr "We've got room in our cargo hold for some loot."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:11411
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "We have to take down at least one of their shields to get loot."
msgstr "We have to take down at least one of their shields to get loot."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:11426
#, lua-format
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "At least one of %s's shield arcs is down."
msgstr "At least one of %s's shield arcs is down."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:11438
#, lua-format
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "%s's shield is down."
msgstr "%s's shield is down."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:11450
#, lua-format
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "%s does not have any shields."
msgstr "%s does not have any shields."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:11467
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "We can't get loot if our shields are up."
msgstr "We can't get loot if our shields are up."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:11476
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "Our shields are down."
msgstr "Our shields are down."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:11528
#, lua-format
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "%s has cargo and ordnance we could get:%s."
msgstr "%s has cargo and ordnance we could get:%s."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:11535
#, lua-format
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "%s has cargo we could get:%s."
msgstr "%s has cargo we could get:%s."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:11541
